    "bbox": [
      52.08,
      662.59,
      557.92,
      708.34
    ],
    "text": "Showers or thundershowers will occur at several places in the sea areas off the coast extending from Puttalam to Hambantota via Colombo and Galle. Showers or thundershowers may occur at a few places in the other sea areas around the island in the evening or night.",
    "fonts": [
